[00:25.11]kahe ko kahe ko kahe kau
[00:27.55]kaalaa kaagad kaalee kalam
[00:29.99]kaal likhe kaal mitaave
[00:32.44]kaa kaa arth na jaane koi
[00:34.88]kaa...
[00:37.32]kaaa...
[00:39.77]kaahe kaahe kaahe re kaa
[00:42.21]ka kha ga gha – sab teraa khel
[00:44.65]khaali kaagar kaahe bulaave
[00:47.10]kaam krodh kaa maare mel
[00:49.54]kyaa...
[00:51.98]ka kau ke
[00:54.43]ka se kau – teeno taar
[00:56.87]ken kabhyaam – dohraa dvaar
[00:59.32]kai kahe kai baar
[01:01.76]kaa ke beech mein kaun karaar
[01:04.20]ken kabhyaam kai
[01:06.65]kavim kaviim kavayah
[01:09.09]kavi bhi kya jaane kaa kaa arth
[01:11.53]kavi bhi phire kaal ke harth
[01:13.98]kahaam katham kathaam
[01:16.42]kahaam gayaa kaun kaho
[01:18.86]katham kathaam kahe kaho
[01:21.31]kathaam ki kathaa kya kya
[01:23.75]kaal ke kaan mein kaun kaa kya
[01:26.19]kasmin kyo keshu
[01:28.64]kasmin jag mein kyo phire
[01:31.08]keshu hi kaa kaanta chire
[01:33.53]kyo kahe kaal kaa khel kare
[01:35.97]kaa kaa bandhan kaahe dhare
[01:38.41]ka kaa rahasya niraalaa
[01:40.86]rahasya nahi to raaj hai kaala
[01:43.30]kaal kaa kaam hai khel dikhaana
[01:45.74]ka kaa arth hai kaal bhulaana
[01:48.19]kya kaun kab kaise kahan
[01:50.63]nai bramaand racha daalaa
[01:53.07]e mera naanak we matwaalaa
[01:55.52]naanak bhi ka kaa kahe gaye
[01:57.96]kaa kaa uttar kaal se gaye
[02:00.40]maatvaale ko kaun sambhaale
[02:02.85]kaa kaa chakkar kaal nivaale
[02:05.29]kaa de chakkar k nu dala
[02:07.74]kada kachcha karpaan kanghi kesh
[02:10.18]kadaa na chhute – kaal kaa haath
[02:12.62]kachcha kaahe – kachcha saath
[02:15.07]karpaan uthaave – kaal kaa naath
[02:17.51]kanghi kare – kesh bhi raakhe
[02:19.95]kaal ke aage sab kuchh bhaakhe
[02:22.40]sakkhe purus nu ditte bhesh
[02:24.84]sakkha kaun – jo kaal na jaane
[02:27.28]bhesh badale – kaal pahichaane
[02:29.73]kaal jo pahichaan liya
[02:32.17]ka kaa rahasya aap hi aaya
[02:34.61]chanddalaa de dna nai
[02:37.06]onnu wi dohkaa de daalaa
[02:39.50]dohkaa kaun – jo kaal de daale
[02:41.95]kaal se bachna – ka kaa samhaale
[02:44.39]ka kaa bina kaal kaa raaj
[02:46.83]ka kaa mile to kaal ka kaaj
[02:49.28]ka kau ke
[02:51.72]ken kabhyaam kai
[02:54.16]kavim kaviim kavayah
[02:56.61]kahaam katham kathaam
[02:59.05]kasmin kyo keshu
[03:01.49]ka kaa rahasya niraalaa
[03:03.94]kya kaun kab kaise kahan
[03:06.38]nai brahmaand racha daalaa
[03:08.82]e mera naanak we matwaalaa
[03:11.27]kaa de chakkar k nu dala
[03:13.71]kada kachcha karpaan kanghi kesh
[03:16.16]sakkhe purus nu ditte bhesh
[03:18.60]chanddalaa de dna nai
[03:21.04]onnu wi dohkaa de daalaa
[03:23.49]ka... kaa... kya... kyo...
[03:25.93]kahan kab tak kisko kyon
[03:28.37]khalq khuda kufr karam
[03:30.82]khoon kaleje kaa, kaghaz kalam
[03:33.26]khaali karo kya kahe kabeer
[03:35.70]kankar kaahe karein taqeer
[03:38.15]kuttaa kaalaa kya jaane
[03:40.59]kaaba kaun, kaun but-khaana
[03:43.03]kaafir kahe kaaba chale
[03:45.48]qazi kahe qabar chale
[03:47.92]kaa de chakkar mein kaalaa phire
[03:50.36]kaal kaa kaal kahaan se tire
[03:52.81]kadaa na toota, kes na kaate
[03:55.25]kanghi na rukhi, karpaan na haathe
[03:57.70]kachcha kaahe kaa rakhdaa baandh
[04:00.14]kaal kaa khel, na jaane aadh
[04:02.58]khaak se kaaya, kaaya se kaam
[04:05.03]kaam se krodh, krodh se jaam
[04:07.47]kaun si kaayaa kaahe si kathaa
[04:09.91]kaa kaa rahasya – bas kaal kaa naath
[04:12.36]kahaam gaye sab kavim kaviim
[04:14.80]kavayah kaahe bane nayeem
[04:17.24]kasmin jag mein kyo nahi chain
[04:19.69]keshu hi to hai maaya mail
[04:22.13]ka kau ke – teeno paal
[04:24.58]ken kabhyaam – dohe ka jaal
[04:27.02]kai – kaahe ko kai baar
[04:29.46]kathaam katham – kahta hai koi bichaar
[04:31.91]ka kaa rahasya – kya bataaye
[04:34.35]kya likhe kaghaz kya mitaaye
[04:36.79]jeh kavan kahan kis karan
[04:39.24]so kaal – so khaas – so khanjar – so kiran
